// Demo score for testing Rustel in VS Code.
//
// Try these checks:
// 1. Hover over `note`, `s`, `lpf`, or `room` to view reference docs from `rustel lsp`.
// 2. Type a dot after `.gain(0.25)` to test method completion.
// 3. Put your cursor inside `s("sine")` and trigger completion to list built-in sounds.
// 4. Press Ctrl+Enter (Cmd+Enter on macOS) to play, and Ctrl+. (Cmd+.) to stop.
// 5. Uncomment the last line to see a live diagnostic from `rustel lsp`.

setcps(0.55)

$: note("c4 e4 g4 b4 a4 g4 e4 d4")
  .s("triangle")
  .lpf(1800)
  .gain(0.25)

$: note("<c2 a1 f1 g1>")
  .s("sawtooth")
  .lpf(420)
  .gain(0.22)

// Uncomment to verify live lint diagnostics:
// note("c4").lpf(
